WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:03,140
It's a pity that I am only a first-level lord now

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:05,340
Cannot contract the second Zero Beast

3
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:24,140
Little one, it’s not easy for you to travel fast in the wild.

4
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,380
I have many more odd orders like this

5
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:28,040
as long as you follow me

6
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:32,470
How about I give you a first-order zero order every seven days?

7
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:41,860
From now on we will be a family

8
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:43,060
This is your elder brother

9
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:44,940
He will take care of you from now on

10
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:45,940
You take his last name

11
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:48,730
It will be called Xuebao from now on.
